{"id":"u-5fbb71df-0a43-477b-b4ec-fff9fec2b263","src":"community","title":"RUSSIAN PLAGUE","author":"Matei","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/lUiTuA-global-elite-tier-program","desc":"RUSSIAN PLAGUE\n\nA 12-week program for people who refuse to choose between looking like a statue and lifting like a machine. Three days a week you squat heavy, pull heavy and press heavy, and you train the abs like any other muscle: loaded, progressive, relentless. Eat right, sleep more, lift heavy, repeat. You come out lean, hard and stronger than you look.\n\nAdd at least 2.5 kg to every exercise every week until you pass the fuck out or break your bones. Then go to the ER, come back the next week, and continue the program as intended.\n\nIf you are a begginer do not follow this program. Seriously don’t! Go do kiddy stuff or somethin, like calisthenics.","level":["Advanced","Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-14T00:08:40.885Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["PATIENT ZERO","PLAGUE INC GAMEPLAY","EXTINCTION"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"pct":85,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Chin-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"x":4}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hanging Leg Raise","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}],"note":"Round spine , pause at squeeze"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Ab Wheel","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Farmer's Walk (Weighted)","sets":[{"amrap":1}],"note":"3 rounds"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"pct":85,"x":3}]},{"n":"Front Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":3